# Walking Ballista's "This creature enters with X +1/+1 counters on it" is its own replacement effect (CR 614.1c), and which
# replacement effects apply to a permanent entering is judged on it "as it would exist on the battlefield, taking into
# account ... continuous effects that already exist and would apply to the permanent" (CR 614.12). With Dress Down out, a
# Ballista there would be a creature with no abilities: cast for X = 2 it enters with no counters, a 0/0 - Dress Down sets
# no base power and toughness - and the state-based actions put it into the graveyard (CR 704.5f).
# walking-ballista-cast-for-x-two-enters-with-two-counters-and-pings-with-them is the control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Dress Down
Walking Ballista
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

